{
  "id": "battle-arena-decks-rayquaza-vs-keldeo",
  "name": "Battle Arena Decks: Rayquaza vs. Keldeo",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "The third Battle Arena Decks, on sale from 21 September 2016: two 60-card decks built around Dragons Exalted's Rayquaza-EX and Boundaries Crossed's Keldeo-EX, with two coins, deck boxes, a playmat and a code card for the Pokémon Trading Card Game Online. The decks held Karen XY177, found nowhere else, sheen holofoil prints of the two Pokémon-EX, first printed in mirror holofoil, and non-holofoil prints of cards first printed as holos: N BW100 without its Pokémon League logo, the Victini of Noble Victories and of Legendary Treasures, Legendary Treasures' Zapdos, XY's Raichu and BREAKthrough's Octillery. Non-holo Blastoise from Boundaries Crossed and Milotic from Primal Clash came again from earlier Theme Decks.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Bulbapedia: XY TCG Series merchandise, Battle Arena Decks: Rayquaza vs. Keldeo",
